[1.029 A050] A.1000 > B.2000: A 39937:40961(1024) ack 501 win 65535
[1.029 A051] A.1000 > B.2000: A 40961:41985(1024) ack 501 win 65535
[1.029 A052] A.1000 > B.2000: A 41985:43009(1024) ack 501 win 65535
[1.029 A053] A.1000 > B.2000: A 43009:44033(1024) ack 501 win 65535
[1.029 A054] A.1000 > B.2000: A 44033:45057(1024) ack 501 win 65535
[1.029 A055] A.1000 > B.2000: A 45057:46081(1024) ack 501 win 65535
